.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNQXJk2uOzlAGmzVpT8SV6IhNdhOMYS2_reUQgFCE3OFw&oe=6AC1124E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot0.png", "id": "1050089296957888", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393507_1050089300291221_4005946916113578811_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JaB7LTvAiIwQ7kNvwHM6w0Q&_nc_oc=AdoJGaUFDy9rsU1j5OVmrD_H2OGWgRN9uzZJSyhmr6hBED5KnVGdsaEoZIVRrv6p_5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMLFhhBhc4QpyonXnhJ-_g-lYNEld1EfuVOWilpMNiaQQ&oe=6AC129A1"}, {"file_name": "screenshot1.png", "id": "1665609347391518", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392309_1665609350724851_6308235494894957927_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VUkDQmPRgUIQ7kNvwG8eiLN&_nc_oc=AdpC3mUNLPkfK0_Mv2x9M823JDTseK2QkPQkvheGcRPy1uq79koIbznzHH9sqGPzLlI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNULmiX_BLEOjF_6lbLF4Hal2MqaCqCIv5nx4qzlQIs0w&oe=6AC1245D"}, {"file_name": "screenshot6.png", "id": "943327351077800", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/468741112_943327354411133_7842717366783559423_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cN7f3dGreqcQ7kNvwHhgc1J&_nc_oc=AdqL0mJj9yptjIiMWJUXmvvdEtqIyaQRcNB0dT9Oi-xCqroULaufb6dGNpm-SrnGsHE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN8IXFIMDv9Qh5wkB5FEkQ7jthw55oM-ARiuRZF1H7__Q&oe=6AC1016B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscapefull3.png", "id": "1181005139718728", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036670_1181005143052061_709758329527305958_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kna9XvlTaq8Q7kNvwEbc1H3&_nc_oc=AdoqHOnEX0ZIRXag8mzmfJ06Jayy5rpj7Qc6cdd9j7zu2syjp8UlsfZ-i6udHM2bQeY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMyvxvzimoSrm4LvdlJ5Rqz48dQdpwf0z8O-c1j2Cm2hA&oe=6AC12632"}, "display_name": "3D Mahjong worlds - Quest", "keywords": ["mahjong", "board", "relax", "classic", "puzzle"], "long_description": "This is the VR implementation of the classic Mahjong game\n\nWhether you are a mahjong master or a beginner, this game will be your best choice!\nCreative design of solid 3D mahjong levels, and simple game rules, suitable for everyone!\nIt\u2019s transformed from the traditional matching game and brings a relaxing experience to players in a 3D way.\nBe the master and pair all the cubes to eliminate them on over 30 levels!\n\nGame features:\n\n- 60 levels\n- Mixed reality support\n- 5 Relaxing environment with daytime and night mode, plus a random option.\n- 8 Tile set\n- Classic and 3D style levels.\n- English, Hungarian and Simplified Chinese languages.\n- Rotate, move and zoom the board.\n\n\n{808240775651188}", "short_description": "This is the VR implementation of the classic Mahjong game\nCreative design of solid 3D mahjong levels and simple game rules!\n5 relaxing environments, 8 various colourful tile sets,60 levels and night mode! Mixed Reality support"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo2-chinese.png", "id": "1628457724592817", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75568725_1628457727926150_374747833840138475_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u9_E05D19m0Q7kNvwFhSRBc&_nc_oc=Adri7NMXuwqVF8EmTHWyH5BYoVrCs0Rwh26x5OerYrACl7ECpCk_-19iCprI-U-yb7U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM7Dqo-AVPAe8wb1uUo5PisLykReJGtnSSLe23ZhNXUyw&oe=6AC12C80"}, {"file_name": "landscapefull-chinese.png", "id": "1452552865375930", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210891_1452552868709263_7671164401111142330_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bcwfz01qP_8Q7kNvwHcJj5_&_nc_oc=Adpt-TsluQsuMvnAeA9K6bGjfTxbXYPykEDx6EdQuZkwqe2gJhQ2DugnGuG6kYIv7AM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNcshAMdOLFiLTYRLOLnl_Uw1Xo4jqNq6ilsoz-UFxtqg&oe=6AC11D2B